  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nLeaves fluttering in the wind, sparkling sunlight filtering through the trees, and tiny flowers that invite your touch—Yuragi is a recipe that gently captures these everyday scenes and the beauty of fleeting moments. A slightly brighter exposure and subdued contrast create a soft, gentle overall feel. The tones are shifted slightly toward blue to evoke a cool, clean ambiance. This recipe works beautifully for snapshots of walking paths, highlighting flowers and greenery. It's also well-suited for natural-light portraits, as it renders skin tones in a realistic and flattering way.",
